  "description": "Compile-time CQRS dispatcher for .NET using Roslyn source generators. Add [Handler] to your handler class — AutoDispatch generates a strongly-typed IDispatcher interface and Dispatcher implementation at build time. No IRequest<T> marker interfaces, no reflection, zero runtime overhead. Works with ASP.NET Core, Worker Services, and any Microsoft.Extensions.DependencyInjection project.",
